MPRINT(TABCOUNT):   * CHISQ, CMH, EXACT p-values ;
MPRINT(TABCOUNT):   *---------------------------------------;
MPRINT(TABCOUNT):   *----------------------------------------------------------------------------;
MPRINT(TABCOUNT):   * If overall p-values are requested, generate and add to the dataset ;
MPRINT(TABCOUNT):   *----------------------------------------------------------------------------;
MPRINT(TABCOUNT):   *----------------------------------------------------------------------------;
MPRINT(TABCOUNT):   * If pairwise p-values are requested, generate and add to the dataset ;
